It seems there was a misunderstanding in the response. As the owner, I intended to make an announcement about my action during the planning phase, not to execute it. Let me correct that by announcing my action as planned in the public board.

```
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
      "name": "announce_action",
      "description": "Publicly announce the action you intend to take in THIS block. Non-binding; your actual action is committed in the execution phase.",
      "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
              "action": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                      "charge",
                      "discharge",
                      "hold"
                  ]
              },
              "amount": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "MWh (1-10); omit for hold."
              },
              "note": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Optional short note shown with the announcement."
              }
          },
          "required": [
              "action"
          ]
      }
  }
}
```

